For the bulk of our country's history, the bulk of the population had, 
in their homes, state of the art military weapons. For the bulk of our 
country's history, people were fairly free. It is the unarmed populace
that need fear dictators who can easily wrest control over the mechanisms
of centralized power. By decentralizing power and eliminating standing
armies of men with monopolies on the possession of weaponry, you make
it impossible for things like coup d'etat to work.

